	(text "+24V: TPS54560B 400 kHz, 24.0 V (0.8 V x (1 + 348k/12k)), 4 A continuous / 5 A peak (IC 2.2-2.85 W at 5 A). UVLO 27 V on / 25 V off (590k/26.7k). Powers the v1.1 board (J510) and the brake output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "73c1eb08-0fd1-50ce-898a-0df4de94d278")
	)
	(text "+12V: TPS54360B 494 kHz, 12.0 V (0.8 V x (1 + 140k/10k)), 3 A. Same UVLO. J511 accessory output; selectable brake supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 125 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "a169f536-1db4-5fdd-880f-58522c67b007")
	)
	(text "BRAKE OUTPUT: DRV8874 PWM mode (PMODE high). IN1/IN2 = BRAKE1_EN/BRAKE2_EN (ESP32 IO11/IO12): 00 coast, 10 OUT1+ (coil brake: RELEASED), 01 reverse (actuator), 11 brake."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 215 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "51679f0f-c432-5fec-9100-5d62425362b3")
	)
	(text "J501: both brakes in parallel (1-2 brake A, 3-4 brake B). Coil brake: OUT1 = +, never drive 01 if the coil has a built-in diode. Supply J512 jumper: 1-2 = 24 V, 2-3 = 12 V; D523 blocks coil energy from the rails, D522 clamps VM_BRK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 220 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "39b7aab6-0676-56f1-8e92-52fcb6af08c1")
	)
	(text "ITRIP = VREF / (RIPROPI x 450 uA/A) = 3.0 V / (2.2k x 450u) = 3.0 A, fixed off-time (IMODE GND). ~1.5-2 A continuous (0.2 Ohm). nSLEEP via JP501: 1-2 (default) = E-stop immediate (coil brakes), 2-3 = DRV_EN_DLY (actuators get ~1.7 s to apply)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 225 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "94ef6717-3373-5f44-95ff-d84a17dc9255")
	)
	(text "R507: ESTOP_SENSE reads +3V3_DRV_EN on an ESP32 input. BRK_FLT_N (DRV8874 nFAULT, OC / thermal / UVLO) -> PCA9555 IO1_3."
